<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35057" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναυλ-ίξω</span></b> , intr., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dwell</i> or <i>abide in</i> a place, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύκτ᾽ ἐναυλίσαι μίαν</span>
			prob. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hyps.Fr.</u>
				3(1)
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				i8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>take up one's quarters</i> during the night,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύκτα οὐδεὶς ἐναυλίζεται</span>
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ νηῷ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.181
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν Τανάγρῃ νύκτα ἐναυλισάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.15
				</span></i>
			; esp. of soldiers, <i>take up night-quarters, bivouac</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.7.8
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ γῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					5597.14
				</span></i>
			 (Ephesus, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph., of diseases, <i>lodge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ στήθει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat.Hom.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			.</div>
